#: src/languages/elixir.md:270
msgid "Using the Tailwind CSS Language Server with HEEx templates"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:272
msgid ""
"To get all features (autocomplete, linting, and hover docs) from the "
"[Tailwind CSS language server](https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss-"
"intellisense/tree/HEAD/packages/tailwindcss-language-server#readme) in HEEx "
"templates, add the following to your settings file:"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:276
msgid "\"tailwindcss-language-server\""
msgstr "\"tailwindcss-language-server\""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:278
msgid "\"includeLanguages\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:279
msgid "\"elixir\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:279 src/languages/elixir.md:280
msgid "\"html\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:280
msgid "\"heex\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:283
msgid "\"classRegex\""
msgstr "\"classRegex\""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:283
msgid "\"class=\\\"([^\\\"]*)\\\"\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:283
msgid "\"class='([^']*)'\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:290
msgid ""
"With these settings, you will get completions for Tailwind CSS classes in "
"HEEx templates. Examples:"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/elixir.md:292
msgid ""
"```heex\n"
"<%!-- Standard class attribute --%>\n"
"<div class=\"flex items-center <completion here>\">\n"
"  <p class=\"text-lg font-bold <completion here>\">Hello World</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<%!-- With Elixir expression --%>\n"
"<div class={\"flex #{@custom_class} <completion here>\"}>\n"
"  Content\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<%!-- With Phoenix function --%>\n"
"<div class={class_list([\"flex\", \"items-center\", \"<completion here>\"])}"
">\n"
"  Content\n"
"</div>\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

